\fs32 1.1 Terms of use\par
 \par
\fs24 The copyright holders do not provide any warranty and assume no liability for the free and open source software components. Note that any modification can void any warranty claim.\par
\par
The system allows the integration of external sources, such as character sets / videos / Javascript code etc. It is the responsibility of the user of the LVD tool to ensure that these sources are royalty-free or free of copyright. \par
\par
\fs32 1.2 Warranty and Liability\par
 \par
\fs24 Please note the applicable terms and conditions of Third Party Software included in SIGMATEK\rquote s products, namely packages listed under section "3. Package details for License usage".\par
\par
The parties are aware that SIGMATEK\rquote s products and services contain or use software and/ or technology that cannot be fully tested for flawlessness. In light of this fact that the standardised regulations on warranty and liability for \ldblquote everyday goods\rdblquote  cannot apply SIGMATEK\rquote s products and services, the parties agree the following:\par
