The Parties agree that no legal warranty shall apply on and in the context of SIGMATEK\rquote s products and/ or services. SIGMATEK\rquote s products and/ or services are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and noninfringement.\par
\par
SIGMATEK shall only be held liable by the Customer and or parties falling into the sphere of the Customer in the event of gross negligence with regard to cardinal contractual obligations - in this respect exclusively up to the maximum liability limit agreed herewith, which corresponds to the payments actually made by the Customer - and otherwise SIGMATEK shall only be held liable in the event of intent, personal injury or mandatory liability provisions (in particular in accordance with the statutory provisions on product liability).\par
The limitation of SIGMATEK\rquote s liability shall also apply to all employees, subcontractors, etc.\par
\par
The relationship between SIGMATEK and the Customer shall be governed exclusively by Austrian law, excluding the conflict of laws rules and excluding the UN Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods. The exclusive place of jurisdiction shall be that of SIGMATEK.\par
